Where things stand: the last 10 sessions each landed both of their tasks, with no reverts in 14 days. CI has been green since the test-file key-scrub fix 4 days ago. A real -p call against claude-opus-5-5 worked. The run cancelled on 2026-10-22 was followed by three successful runs; I didn't open its log.

